      },
      "message": "docs(site): keyboard shortcut and mouse reference\n\nNew guide page listing every keyboard shortcut and mouse gesture bound\nin crates/ui, with Windows/Linux and macOS columns (egui's command\nmodifier is Cmd on macOS; pick add-to-selection uses the real Control\nkey on all platforms, noted against PR #1242). Unbound items the\nissue asked about are listed under \"Not bound yet\". Linked from\nfirst-run.\n\nFixes #1246\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
